  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive). Pattern: Xが{色|いろ}づく.\n\nASPECT: ている indicates a state of having changed color.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {葉|は}が{色|いろ}づく (leaves change color)\n- {紅葉|こうよう}が{色|いろ}づく (autumn foliage turns color)\n- {赤|あか}く{色|いろ}づく (to turn red)\n- {黄色|きいろ}く{色|いろ}づく (to turn yellow)\n\nSEASON: This verb is particularly associated with autumn ({秋|あき}) when describing foliage.",
